  "notice": "VISUAL morphology only. Every threshold in this file is a VIEW threshold that chooses how a reported entity is DRAWN. None is a gameplay rule: nothing here decides that a settlement is a town, that an institution exists, grows or matures, or what a formation can do. Schema: docs/architecture/world-visualization.md.",
